WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.139
Lateral thinking, from Edward de Bono.

00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:06.323
Vertical thinking moves logically with the pieces you have.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:09.754
Lateral thinking changes the pieces by questioning the assumption.

00:00:09.804 --> 00:00:14.338
Ideas are new combinations, and AI should be an antagonist.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:17.342
Extra gum joined two things: gum and the checkout scanner.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:21.983
The Bad Breath Index nudged shoppers right at the till.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.282
Rexona joined a logo with an armpit: Pitvertising.

00:00:26.332 --> 00:00:29.362
No new inputs, just a new connection.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:31.243
Use it like this:

00:00:31.293 --> 00:00:32.093
write the obvious answer,

00:00:31.576 --> 00:00:36.505
then reframe the problem so competitors can't copy you.
